### 28 19413592 id= 19413592 type= pmid year= 2009 pubtypes= ['Journal Article', "Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't"]
TITLE: Additive beneficial effects of amlodipine and atorvastatin in reversing advanced cardiac hypertrophy in elderly spontaneously hypertensive rats.
RULE: INCLUDE | eligible randomised controlled trial: intervention statin, comparator control, population elderly — P/I/C/design met.
SPAN: population “…cardiac hypertrophy in elderly spontaneously hypertens…”; comparator “…: (i) a vehicle-treated control group; (ii) an amlodipi…”
